---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - SmartStaff Attendance Register | DigiHawke Media"
  metaTitle="Privacy Policy - SmartStaff Attendance Register | DigiHawke Media"
  description="Privacy Policy for SmartStaff Attendance Register (SmartStaff AI) mobile application developed by DigiHawke Media. Learn about our data handling, local storage, Google Drive backup, and privacy practices."
  canonicalURL="https://digihawke.com/privacy-smartstaff"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-lowest to-background relative select-text">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--color-surface-container-low),_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-left">
      
      <!-- Top Badge & Header -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-[4px] text-xs font-mono font-medium bg-secondary/10 text-secondary border border-secondary/20">
          Mobile Application
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-[4px] text-xs font-mono font-medium bg-primary-container/20 text-primary border border-primary/20">
          SmartStaff AI
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-4 text-glow-indigo leading-tight">
        Privacy Policy for SmartStaff Attendance Register
      </h1>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-outline-variant/40">
        <span>Last Updated: September 25, 2026</span>
        <span class="text-outline-variant">•</span>
        <span>Developed by <strong class="text-white">DigiHawke Media</strong></span>
      </div>

      <!-- App Context Card -->
      <div class="mb-10 p-5 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60">
        <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed">
          DigiHawke Media (“we,” “our,” or “us”) operates the <strong class="text-white">SmartStaff Attendance Register</strong> mobile application (the “App”, also known as <strong class="text-white">SmartStaff AI</strong>). This Privacy Policy informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, storage, and disclosure of information when you use our App.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Policy Content Blocks -->
      <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-sans leading-relaxed flex flex-col gap-8">
        
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id="information-collected">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-secondary font-mono text-base">1.</span> Information We Collect and How We Use It
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            To deliver an efficient, automated attendance and salary calculation service, the App processes the following categories of information:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Account & Contact Information:</strong> When you register or log in, we may collect your Phone Number or Email address through Firebase Authentication to securely verify and authenticate your business account.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Business, Staff & Attendance Records:</strong> Employee names, contact details, daily attendance entries, overtime hours, wage rates, advance payments, and cash book transactions entered into the App are processed to provide staff tracking, wage calculations, and PDF salary slip generation.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Storage & Camera Permissions:</strong> If you choose to attach an employee photo or business logo, the App requests local storage or camera access solely to select and display the image within your records.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Device Identifiers & Diagnostics:</strong> We may collect non-personal device information, advertising IDs, and diagnostic crash logs to detect errors, prevent fraud, and optimize app performance.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id="data-storage-cloud-backup">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-secondary font-mono text-base">2.</span> Data Storage & Google Drive Cloud Backup
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            Your business staff records, attendance registers, and cash book ledgers are <strong class="text-white">stored locally on your device</strong>. 
          </p>
          <p>
            If you enable the optional Google Drive Cloud Backup feature, your data is backed up directly and securely to your own private Google Drive account using Google APIs. We do not sell, rent, or monetize your business or staff data to any third party.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id="third-party-services">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-secondary font-mono text-base">3.</span> Third-Party Services
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            The App integrates with trusted third-party SDKs that process information in accordance with their respective privacy policies:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Google Play Services:</strong> Core Android system capabilities and app updates.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Google Firebase (Authentication & Core):</strong> Secure user authentication (Phone OTP / Google Sign-In).
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Google Mobile Ads (AdMob):</strong> Displays banner and interstitial advertisements to free-tier users. AdMob may use device advertising identifiers (GAID) to deliver relevant ads.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id="data-retention-deletion">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-secondary font-mono text-base">4.</span> Data Retention and Account Deletion
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            You have full control over your business and personnel data:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
            <li>
              You can view, edit, or delete any employee, attendance log, or transaction record at any time directly within the App.
            </li>
            <li>
              To delete your account and all associated cloud sync identifiers, you can use the in-app account deletion option in Settings or submit a deletion request to <a href="mailto:privacy@digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline font-mono">privacy@digihawke.com</a>. Upon request, all associated identifiers will be permanently removed.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id="childrens-privacy">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-secondary font-mono text-base">5.</span> Children’s Privacy
          </h2>
          <p>
            Our App is a commercial business utility designed for business owners, contractors, and managers aged 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 6 -->
        <section class="scroll-mt-24" id="security">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-secondary font-mono text-base">6.</span> Security
          </h2>
          <p>
            We implement industry-standard encryption protocols (HTTPS/TLS) for data in transit and adhere to applicable data protection regulations including the Information Technology Act and DPDP Act of India.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 7: Contact Us Card -->
        <section class="p-6 rounded-[4px] bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/60 scroll-mt-24" id="contact-us">
          <h2 class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
            7. Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4 text-on-surface-variant">
            If you have any questions, feedback, or data privacy requests regarding SmartStaff Attendance Register, please contact us at:
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
            <div><strong class="text-white font-sans">Company:</strong> DigiHawke Media</div>
            <div><strong class="text-white font-sans">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@digihawke.com" class="text-secondary hover:underline">privacy@digihawke.com</a></div>
            <div><strong class="text-white font-sans">Website:</strong> <a href="https://digihawke.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-secondary hover:underline">https://digihawke.com</a></div>
            <div><strong class="text-white font-sans">Address:</strong> Barhaj, Dist - Deoria, U.P. - 274601, India</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Navigation link to main agency privacy policy -->
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/40 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-on-surface-variant">
          <span>Looking for agency services policy?</span>
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-secondary hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
            View DigiHawke Media Main Privacy Policy &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
